    "英日4viewで6API/6stack effect/12prose、45inlinecode/22nativeIDs、GC親10+子6を確認。",
    "JA GCPARAMの6断片とchild各2段落はtightな単一説明へ復元。日本語両幅でval=-1条件/param must6値/最後のfinalizer should notを画像とactualDOMで確認。",
